@fact lyra.prodigy
# en: The pyromancy prodigy of House Vaneshade. Everyone knows the name, and she makes sure of it.
text [7f3f8a] = 凡妮希德家族的火焰术天才。人人都知道这个名字，她也确保人人都知道。

@fact lyra.toast
# en: She can incinerate a target at forty paces. She cannot make toast.
text [8eef62] = 她能在四十步外把靶子烧成灰。她不会烤面包片。
# en: Catch her at breakfast.
hint [cbaba1] = 早饭时逮住她。

@fact lyra.mother
# en: Her mother has never once told her "well done".
text [a56886] = 她的母亲从没对她说过一句“做得好”。
# en: Get closer, and ask about her letters home.
hint [b0f195] = 跟她再熟一些，问问她寄回家的信。

@fact lyra.second_place
# en: She came second in the Winter Trials once. Her mother wrote to ask who beat her.
text [c586c0] = 她在冬季试炼中得过一次第二名。她母亲写信来问是谁赢了她。
# en: Ask her about the Winter Trials.
hint [dc6f35] = 问问她冬季考核的事。

@fact lyra.burnout
# en: She studies until she collapses, and begs you not to let her mother find out.
text [8e25bd] = 她会一直学到昏过去，还求你别让她母亲知道。
# en: Watch how late her lamp burns.
hint [a8cd57] = 看看她的灯亮到多晚。

@fact lyra.rival
# en: You are the only person here who makes her better. She hates it. She doesn't want it to stop.
text [049900] = 你是这里唯一能让她变得更好的人。她恨这一点。她不想让它停下。
# en: Be the rival she can't shake.
hint [ac2524] = 做她甩不掉的那个对手。

@fact lyra.inheritance
# en: Her mother threatened her inheritance over you. She set the letter on fire.
text [b8b62f] = 她母亲为了你，拿她的继承权来威胁她。她把那封信烧了。
# en: Her mother may have something to say about you.
hint [418d0a] = 她母亲也许对你有话要说。

@fact lyra.wildfire
# en: Vaneshades sleep exactly eight hours; she can't sleep. Her grandmother's spell, Wildfire, was only for people she trusted, and Lyra has never had anyone to teach it to.
text [981a53] = 凡妮希德家的人睡足整整八个小时；她却睡不着。她祖母的咒语“野火”只传给信得过的人，而莱拉从来没有可以传授的人。
# en: Get truly close to her.
hint [46a4dd] = 和她真正亲近起来。

@fact lyra.flourish
# en: Her family has opened its duels with the same ribbon-of-flame flourish for two hundred years. Teaching it outside the family is not done.
text [4802ff] = 两百年来，她家决斗开场都用同一个火焰缎带起手式。把它教给外人，是不合规矩的。
# en: Ask her to teach you something of her family's.
hint [68d362] = 请她教你一点她家传的东西。
